Reserve As Work 10,1000
Print #1,Length(10);Start(10)>0
Poke Start(10),65 : Doke Start(10)+2,$1234 : Loke Start(10)+4,$DEADBEEF
Print #1,Peek(Start(10));Hex$(Deek(Start(10)+2));Hex$(Leek(Start(10)+4))
Fill Start(10) To Start(10)+100,$01020304 : Print #1,Hex$(Leek(Start(10)+96))
Copy Start(10),Start(10)+16 To Start(10)+200 : Print #1,Peek(Start(10)+203)
Print #1,Hunt(Start(10) To Start(10)+999,"A")>0
Erase 10 : Print #1,Length(10)
Reserve As Chip Data 11,256 : Print #1,Length(11) : Erase 11
B=0 : Bset 3,B : Print #1,B;Btst(2,4);Btst(1,4)
B=$81 : Rol.b 1,B : Print #1,Hex$(B) : Ror.w 1,B : Print #1,Hex$(B)
